    "description": "<b>Video maker with photos & music</b> is a powerful tool to create video from photos and music with an extremely diverse and unique photo library, sound effects, overlay effects, frames...\r\n\r\nPhoto video maker with music is exactly the application you need to create attractive music video or photo video to share right away with friends, and lovers in special days.\r\n\r\nPhoto video maker app is like a professional tool for video editing and help you easily:\r\n - Add Audio to Video\r\n - change video speed to make fast or slow motion\r\n - trim video to make shorter video\r\n \r\nDownload Video maker with photo & music now and become an expert at creating movies with photos and music. No video editing experience is required.\r\n\r\nDownload ready 100% and No watermark! \r\n\r\nMain function Photo Video maker with music:\r\n\r\n<b>*Photo video maker: </b>\r\n- create videos from photos and music: choose your most favorite photos, customize effect transitions, edit photos, add music from the library or from your device, choose the frame that suits the theme you create, add layer videos overlay live layer effect\r\n- Select the appropriate transition time for the photos\r\n- edit photos right in the photo video maker, making photos look better than ever\r\n- Export videos from the music video maker to the resolution you select, wait a bit and enjoy the video artwork from photos and music you've just created.\r\n\r\n<b>* Add Audio to Video: </b>\r\n- change original music of video by interesting audio that you shoose from library or on your device\r\n\r\n<b>* Video cutter: </b>\r\n- Select and trim the video as you want. Customize video length and share to Instagram. Export video in high quality.\r\n\r\n<b>* Change video speed: </b>\r\n- You can change the speed for video fast or slow-motion control (Adjust from 0.5x to 2x)\r\n- Increase video speed in a special way\r\n- Slow down the video for memorable moments\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>* No watermark: </b>\r\nAs a good value-oriented photo video maker and never adds Watermark to your videos.\r\n\r\n<b>* Export high-quality video: </b>\r\n1. Choose a resolution to export your video\r\n2. Professional video maker that supports resolutions up to 1080p.\r\n3. Video maker uses advanced technology to save memory space without much quality loss.\r\n\r\nRate Video maker with photo & music app with 5-star on the Play store or share this app if you love it! The music video maker is always available for you to download.",
